    "description": "On this half-day excursion, you’ll explore the neighbourhood of Harlem.\r\n\r\nLed by a long-time Harlem resident, historian and tour guide, you’ll embark on a stroll across the Upper Manhattan neighbourhood famous for its music scene. You’ll learn about the powerful words that were spoken on the district’s streets, shared through music and written in books.\r\n\r\nAs you enjoy the sights, you’ll have an opportunity to listen to your guide’s valuable commentary about Harlem’s rhythm and rhyme, making it one of the most unique areas in New York City.",
